  {
   "key": "0x08..0x0F",
   "name": "OCW3 poll and read",
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "671-684"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "722-727"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In poll mode the INT output works as usual, and service to devices is achieved by software with the poll command.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "671-678",
       "sha": "352183cebbc668080b8bd6749021f7e3830e31c771bbaa1c690ea9d4f33a6c33"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The poll command is OCW3 with P = 1.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "679",
       "sha": "2f429ef3e704150534d8e1857c4c363190fe8ce3002c21af55e848abbd4dbd3d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "After a poll command the next RD pulse is treated as an interrupt acknowledge.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "680-682",
       "sha": "03a44e763498f11447db83d899aaf16d60fa6131cc82de975f827bc913d30656"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "bits 1-0",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The read register command is OCW3 with RR = 1; RIS = 0 selects the IRR and RIS = 1 the ISR.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "722-727",
       "sha": "515469acd4149756abd821bcf25b24966c7e150a2db86c929230e52554a0c911"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "201",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "2",
     "text": "The poll command is not handled: OCW3 with P = 1 only logs a message.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "258",
       "sha": "36fef93f7067a184ceb4f8949a6ab06fa3fd6d895a5c0aa243d4ba4bdce4ffac"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "202",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "3",
     "text": "The poll command is only logged as not handled, so nothing at this write makes the next read an acknowledge.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "258",
       "sha": "36fef93f7067a184ceb4f8949a6ab06fa3fd6d895a5c0aa243d4ba4bdce4ffac"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The acknowledge sets the appropriate IS bit if there is a request and reads the priority level; the interrupt is frozen from WR to RD.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "682-684",
       "sha": "4a5244ab1c28a538d1a62476d958b4b007148e6c774f96711de77802c8a82a39"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "closed": [
    {
